    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. Can you expand a bit on why you'd categorize drill and reggaeton as \"street\" or \"lower-income\" specifically? Is it just the lyrical content or is there more to the \"vibe\" that makes them feel less sophisticated than something like the minimalist aesthetic?",
